    <string name="vnc_stream_mode">VNC</string>
    <string name="vnc_stream_mode_description">Stream over your local network</string>
    <string name="vnc_stream_mode_details">
- Uses the VNC protocol (RFB).\n
- View-only, clients cannot control the device.\n
- Video only, sent as framebuffer updates.\n
- Works on your local network, no internet required.\n
- Built-in VNC server on port 5900 by default.\n
- Supports reverse connect to an external viewer.\n
- Supports Wi-Fi, mobile networks, IPv4, and IPv6.\n
- Highly configurable.
</string>

